# DRAW keymap preset: Deluxe Paint (Amiga DPaint V)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on > < { } ! @ + _ , which are typed with it).
#   Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (u = Undo frees Ctrl+Z and takes u)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Right Amiga (RA) is Ctrl. Shift+1 / Shift+2 are the US-layout ! and @.
# Not in DRAW (no row): D filled freehand, F fill requester, B restore brush,
#   G grid on the brush handle, n centre view, S whole page, j spare page,
#   Z stretch, O trim, a again, Ctrl+R range requester, Alt+T translucency,
#   F1-F8 paint modes, 3 go to frame, Alt (hold) animpaint (DRAW: ANIM > AnimPaint).

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------
101 100 0 0     # d   continuous freehand  -> Brush
102 115 0 0     # s   dotted freehand      -> Dot
105 118 0 0     # v   straight line        -> Line
122 113 0 0     # q   curve                -> Bezier
106 119 0 0     # w   polygon
107 119 2 5     # W   filled polygon
108 114 0 0     # r   rectangle
109 114 2 5     # R   filled rectangle
110 99 0 0      # c   circle               -> Ellipse (Shift while dragging = round)
110 101 0 0     # e   ellipse
111 99 2 5      # C   filled circle
111 101 2 5     # E   filled ellipse
103 102 0 0     # f   fill
1702 97 2 5     # A   airbrush             -> Spray
114 116 0 0     # t   text
116 116 2 5     # T   choose font          -> Text (custom font)
2598 98 0 0     # b   brush selector: drag a box, it becomes the brush
301 117 0 0     # u   undo
302 117 2 5     # U   redo (DPaint's u undoes the undo; Ctrl+Shift+Z still redoes too)
308 107 2 5     # K   CLR - clear
8101 103 0 0    # g   grid on / off
434 109 0 0     # m   magnify on / off     -> Preview window (the magnified view)
406 62 0 0      # >   zoom in
407 60 0 0      # <   zoom out
8007 47 0 0     # /   symmetry             -> cycle symmetry mode

# --- Colour --------------------------------------------------------------------
104 44 0 0      # ,   pick colour          -> Picker
520 91 0 0      # [   previous FG colour
521 93 0 0      # ]   next FG colour
522 123 0 0     # {   previous BG colour
523 125 0 0     # }   next BG colour
2021 112 0 0    # p   palette mixer        -> Color Mixer
2060 9 0 0      # Tab colour cycling on / off
2064 114 4 3    # Alt+r reverse range      -> Color Cycling: Change Direction

# --- Brushes -------------------------------------------------------------------
524 46 0 0      # .   one-pixel brush
602 61 0 0      # =   brush larger
601 45 0 0      # -   brush smaller
1107 104 2 5    # H   double the custom brush
1107 43 0 0     # +   custom brush larger
1108 104 0 0    # h   halve the custom brush
1108 95 0 0     # _   custom brush smaller
315 120 0 0     # x   flip horizontal (the brush when one is loaded)
316 121 0 0     # y   flip vertical
331 120 2 5     # X   double width
333 121 2 5     # Y   double height
319 122 0 0     # z   rotate 90
1104 111 0 0    # o   outline (custom brush, in the BG colour)

# --- Screen --------------------------------------------------------------------
8011 17152 0 0  # F9         menu bar on / off
401 17408 0 0   # F10        toolbox on / off
403 17408 2 5   # Shift+F10  hide every panel (again: show)
403 34048 0 0   # F11        (DRAW's own key for it, kept)

# --- Animation -----------------------------------------------------------------
2502 49 0 0     # 1   previous frame
2503 50 0 0     # 2   next frame
2595 52 0 0     # 4   play in a loop (any of 4 5 6 stops)
2596 53 0 0     # 5   play once
2597 54 0 0     # 6   play ping-pong
2501 33 0 0     # Shift+1 (!)  first frame
2504 64 0 0     # Shift+2 (@)  last frame
2565 55 0 0     # 7   previous AnimBrush cel
2566 56 0 0     # 8   next AnimBrush cel
2576 109 2 5    # M   move requester       -> Move Brush
2505 97 4 3     # Alt+a  animation control panel
2510 61 4 3     # Alt+=  add a frame
2519 108 0 0    # l   LightTable           -> Lightbox
2527 108 4 3    # Alt+l  LightTable dim    -> Onion skin (shows in the lightbox)

# --- Files (Right Amiga = Ctrl) --------------------------------------------------
201 108 1 6     # Ctrl+l  load picture     -> Open
201 111 1 6     # Ctrl+o  (DRAW's Open key, kept: DPaint's load animation)
202 115 1 6     # Ctrl+s  save picture
212 113 1 6     # Ctrl+q  quit
